  "description": "Not all powers are worth having. Dam-Cho Baek has never doubted that—in fact, she’d do anything to get rid of her ability to hear people’s emotions, a divine gift granted by a foreign god. At the end of her wits, she’s shocked to encounter an exorcist named Jin-Hu Do, who might just know how to do it. The catch? To get rid of her ability, she needs to lose her virginity—but hearing people's thoughts makes that impossible. And since she can’t hear Jin-Hu… maybe he could help her with that too. \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
